WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.392
Yue Fei led his great army north, winning battle after battle.

00:00:04.742 --> 00:00:07.022
Reports of victory arrived one after another.

00:00:07.372 --> 00:00:09.964
But the officials at court debated endlessly.

00:00:10.314 --> 00:00:14.346
An imperial edict was issued, ordering him to withdraw his army at once.

00:00:14.696 --> 00:00:18.608
Some feared his glory would overshadow the emperor, and urged the emperor to give the order.

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:21.598
Relay riders on swift horses galloped away.

00:00:21.948 --> 00:00:25.380
Gold plaque after gold plaque urged the great army to return south.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.498
Amid the flying dust, the sound of hooves drew closer and closer.

00:00:29.848 --> 00:00:33.616
The gold plaque was delivered to the camp, and Yue Fei's brow knitted deeply.

00:00:33.966 --> 00:00:37.518
Gazing north, he sighed deeply.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:41.156
Holding the gold plaque, he could not speak for a long time.

00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:44.410
The soldiers packed their bundles with tears in their eyes.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:50.496
Under the setting sun, the great army slowly turned and marched south.

00:00:50.846 --> 00:00:53.798
Everyone looked back at every step, reluctant to leave.

00:00:54.148 --> 00:00:58.492
On the empty battlefield, only a fallen banner remained.

00:00:58.842 --> 00:01:02.130
The twelve gold plaques became an eternal regret.

